      "main_description_html": "\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">QA Tester Summary - Issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2001603303\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-chrome-plugin/issues/6\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-chrome-plugin/issues/6/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-chrome-plugin/issues/6\">#6</a>: Get Business Type</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Suite:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">qa-testing/automation/e2e/issue-6-get-business-type.spec.ts</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">qa-testing/automation/e2e/issue-6-real-plugin-flow.spec.ts</code> (Playwright - Chromium - headed real extension flow)<br>\n<strong>Env:</strong> Local GoThru Chrome Plugin loaded in Chrome, real Google Maps test data <code class=\"notranslate\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/zD8p8w1KEAyaDhZt8</code></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Test Scenario &amp; Result</h3>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Box</th>\n<th>Scenario</th>\n<th>Given -&gt; Expected</th>\n<th>Matrix</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>White</td>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">business_type_extractor_exists</code></td>\n<td>Google category array -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">businessType</code> joins categories</td>\n<td>TP</td>\n<td>Pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Gray</td>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">backend_payload_includes_business_type</code></td>\n<td>extracted place data -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">/gmb</code> payload includes <code class=\"notranslate\">business_type</code></td>\n<td>TP</td>\n<td>Pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Black</td>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">empty_category_no_false_type</code></td>\n<td>empty category array -&gt; no false business type value</td>\n<td>TN</td>\n<td>Pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Real Plugin</td>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">maps_short_link_opens_plugin</code></td>\n<td>real Maps link -&gt; plugin popup shows PlaceID, CID, Lat/Lng after extraction</td>\n<td>TP</td>\n<td>Pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Task Sprint</td>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">#6</code> acceptance</td>\n<td>Get Business Type -&gt; extracted and sent as <code class=\"notranslate\">business_type</code></td>\n<td>TP + TN</td>\n<td>Pass</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Backend Status Code &amp; Review</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Flow: Google Maps place page -&gt; content script extraction -&gt; Chrome storage -&gt; popup UI -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">POST https://chrome.gothru.co/gmb</code></p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Backend result</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n<th>Frontend outcome</th>\n<th>Review</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">POST /gmb</code> success</td>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">2xx</code></td>\n<td>payload includes <code class=\"notranslate\">business_type</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">Data.businessType</code></td>\n<td>Verified by spec payload interception</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">POST /gmb</code> non-success</td>\n<td>non-<code class=\"notranslate\">2xx</code></td>\n<td>content script logs <code class=\"notranslate\">HTTP error! Status: ...</code></td>\n<td>Static code path reviewed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network/fetch error</td>\n<td>rejected fetch</td>\n<td>content script logs <code class=\"notranslate\">Error:</code></td>\n<td>Static code path reviewed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Real Site Evidence Scope</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Google Maps real site was opened from <code class=\"notranslate\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/zD8p8w1KEAyaDhZt8</code>.</li>\n<li>GoThru Chrome Plugin popup was opened against the real Maps page.</li>\n<li>Popup evidence shows PlaceID, CID, and Lat/Lng populated from the real site.</li>\n<li>Business type is validated in the extraction/payload layer; it is not displayed as a separate popup field in the current plugin UI.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Commands</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"node node_modules/@playwright/test/cli.js test --config=qa-testing/playwright.config.ts\nnode node_modules/@playwright/test/cli.js test --config=qa-testing/playwright.config.ts --grep &quot;real Chrome plugin&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">node node_modules/@playwright/test/cli.js <span class=\"pl-c1\">test</span> --config=qa-testing/playwright.config.ts\nnode node_modules/@playwright/test/cli.js <span class=\"pl-c1\">test</span> --config=qa-testing/playwright.config.ts --grep <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>real Chrome plugin<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bug Notes</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>None found for the scoped issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2001603303\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-chrome-plugin/issues/6\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-chrome-plugin/issues/6/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-chrome-plugin/issues/6\">#6</a> flow.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Screenshot/Video Evidence</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Google Maps real site:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-2b396217-f913-4b23-a83f-a81ed8f5ec08.png\"><img width=\"960\" alt=\"Issue #6 real Google Maps page\" src=\"images/image-2b396217-f913-4b23-a83f-a81ed8f5ec08.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Plugin storage/popup state after extraction:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nore